            "notes": "Import code: **EPEHY**\n\nRound 1: \n\nFocus on farming and staying alive.\n\nIt\u2019s not worth going for [Death Step](item_f1e12f6d-48ed-43d3-9dfe-42ffb478029e) yet. You don\u2019t have enough ability damage at this stage, and doing so only signals to the enemy that you\u2019re going for a Death Step build.\n\nPick [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for extra life steal.\n\nIF you have a map where you engage faster after death, then [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) could be a winning pick.",
