            "notes": "Round 3:\n\nYou should have at least $19,000 - if not you can drop [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).\n\nSell all your weapon perks \u2014 switch fully to the Death Step build.\n\nPick [Death Step](item_f1e12f6d-48ed-43d3-9dfe-42ffb478029e) together with  [Wreath of Ruin](item_8581ce4b-3997-4639-91ea-7d7eec3029e1), and add [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) along with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if haven't already. Fill the remaining slots with [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), and if you have extra with [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295).\n\n[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) are MANDATORY until Round 6. In Season 17, there is a lot of burst damage and crowd control that can stun you. The extra armor and shields are the difference between life and death for the entire game.",
