            "notes": "Round 5:\n\nNow focus on more survivability during Death Blossom.\n\nPick up [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c), which gives double lifesteal after using Shadow Step. This is a huge power spike, especially when combined with your existing lifesteal.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) remains a great pick for extra lifesteal and overheal, making you much tankier. With double lifesteal from [Strangle Step](item_5af641ec-a231-43ea-ac83-ea15a542e03c) the 100 overheal is almost always active.\n\nAlso pick [Crowd Control](item_1fc331d5-598d-496c-ad61-2bd12a9ce174), for extra lifesteal and ability power. This is important for both the Shadow Step Blossom combo and the Ultimate Blossom.\n\nFor the last slot, take [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) or [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if you are low on cash.\n\nIf you can afford it, get [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) for the extra ability damage instead of [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e).",
